  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/070f1724-a4e8-44ca-99da-7c6a3ebf5b9c.png\" style=\"width:2.09375in;height:1.16667in\" /><br />A plane which contains the incident ray and the reflected ray must contain the points&nbsp;<math><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>C</mi></math> and should be perpendicular to the given plane.<br />So, equation of the plane is <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>6</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Hence, the distance of the plane from <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>26</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;units",
    "image": null
